        "title_override": "VIVIENNE",
        "description_override": "<p>A softly slouching silhouette, a grained body and smoother contrasting trim. The Vivienne brings together rolled handles, a braided upper edge and warm gold-tone details, with the shape of the bag taking the lead.</p><p><strong>Preorder: all colors are expected to ship in October.</strong></p>"
