            "content": "<p><strong>Approximate nominal dimensions:</strong> 38 × 27 × 20 cm (W × H × D), approximately 15 × 10.5 × 8 inches.</p><p><strong>Visible details:</strong> a softly slouching body, grained surface, smoother contrasting trim, braided upper edge and two rolled top handles.</p><p><strong>Front:</strong> warm gold-tone fittings and inward-falling leather belt details. Curved leather panels define the lower corners.</p><p><strong>Exterior:</strong> no visible logo.</p>",
